  "instructions": [
    "1. Say to your AI: \"Run tool:check-a-pipeline\", and give it stages, transitions, start.",
    "2. The AI calls run_resource_operation at @workshop-tools with method tools:run, tool tool:check-a-pipeline and its input (the worked example shows one).",
